          - heading "“When your shipment needs attention, you shouldn’t have to chase us for answers.”" [level=2] [ref=e195]
          - paragraph [ref=e196]: We monitor every scan milestone. If an expected update is overdue or an exception occurs, our team flags it and notifies you honestly before you have to ask.
        - generic [ref=e197]:
