            - generic [ref=e199]: Transparent Operational Lifecycle
            - heading "The 8-Step Swiftvero Shipping Journey" [level=2] [ref=e200]
            - paragraph [ref=e201]: From your doorstep to global destinations — clear milestones, 24-hour collection guarantee, and certified facility weighing.
          - generic [ref=e202]:
            - generic [ref=e204]:
              - generic [ref=e205]: Step 01
              - heading "Book Your Pickup Online" [level=3] [ref=e206]
              - paragraph [ref=e207]: Declare what you are sending, package count, pickup location, and destination address in minutes.
            - generic [ref=e209]:
              - generic [ref=e210]: Step 02
              - heading "24-Hour Doorstep Collection" [level=3] [ref=e211]
              - paragraph [ref=e212]: Our assigned collection handler arrives within 24 hours to inspect outer condition, count, and sign handover.
            - generic [ref=e214]:
              - generic [ref=e215]: Step 03
              - heading "Arrival at Facility" [level=3] [ref=e216]
              - paragraph [ref=e217]: Your package is safely transferred to our secure operations centre and logged into verified intake.
            - generic [ref=e219]:
              - generic [ref=e220]: Step 04
              - heading "Inspected, Repacked & Weighed" [level=3] [ref=e221]
              - paragraph [ref=e222]: Trained technicians inspect contents, reinforce packaging for air cargo, and weigh on calibrated digital scales.
            - generic [ref=e224]:
              - generic [ref=e225]: Step 05
              - heading "Receive Final Quotation" [level=3] [ref=e226]
              - paragraph [ref=e227]: Get an itemized quote based on verified chargeable weight, chosen carrier service, and optional protection.
            - generic [ref=e229]:
              - generic [ref=e230]: Step 06
              - heading "Approve & Complete Payment" [level=3] [ref=e231]
              - paragraph [ref=e232]: Review every fee transparently. Approve with one click and pay securely with instant VAT receipt.
            - generic [ref=e234]:
              - generic [ref=e235]: Step 07
              - heading "Processed & Dispatched" [level=3] [ref=e236]
              - paragraph [ref=e237]: Air waybills and export customs manifests generated; handed over to authorized global carrier for international uplift.
            - generic [ref=e239]:
              - generic [ref=e240]: Step 08
              - heading "Track Until Delivery" [level=3] [ref=e241]
              - paragraph [ref=e242]: Follow live flight departures, customs clearance, and out-for-delivery milestones. Proactive alerts if updates stall.
